                "question": "<td class=\"bold\" style=\"text-align: left;\" valign=\"top\">Consider the following statements about unemployment in India:<br/>a) Seasonal unemployment is mainly found in urban areas.<br/>b) Educated unemployed people are mainly found in rural areas of India.<br/>c) Higher cropping intensity is desirable for reducing unemployment in the rural economy.<br/>Which of the given statements is/are correct? </td>",
