                "question": "<td class=\"bold\" style=\"text-align: left;\" valign=\"top\">In this question, the statement is followed by two conclusions. Which of the two conclusion(s) is/are true?<br/>Statement: Z &gt; F ≥ A = B = G &gt; S &lt; E<br/>Conclusions:<br/>I. Z &lt; A<br/>II. G &lt; F</td>",
