                "question": "<td class=\"bold\" style=\"text-align: left;\" valign=\"top\">Three of the following words are alike in some manner and hence form a group. Which word does NOT belong to that group? (The words must be considered as meaningful English words and must not be grouped based on the number of letters/number of consonants/vowels in the word)</td>",
