                "question": "<td class=\"bold\" style=\"text-align: left;\" valign=\"top\">In the following question, the statement is followed by two conclusions. Which of the two conclusions is/are true?<br/>Statement: M &lt; K &gt; I &lt; J &gt; H = G ≤ F<br/>Conclusions: I. H= F<br/>II. J &gt; G</td>",
