                "question": "<td class=\"bold\" style=\"text-align: left;\" valign=\"top\">Figure A is related to B in a certain pattern. Following the same pattern, figure C is related to D. Study the pattern and select the figure which should be placed in place of D.<br/><img name=\"2207_264330_0_22704462_mg_mr_35_p1e1_q41.jpg\" src=\"tier-2/2022/2023-03-02-900-1200-E_files/2207_264330_0_22704462_mg_mr_35_p1e1_q41.jpg\"/> </td>",
